A fictional company that demonstrates NeoWiki's structured-data features in a corporate knowledge-base scenario: departments, offices, products, and the relations between them. '''ACME Inc''' is the Main Subject of this page. Each related entity has its own page, linked through the relations shown in the infobox above.

== Which departments are largest by headcount? ==

{{#invoke:NeoWikiDemo|query|SELECT DISTINCT ?Department ?Headcount WHERE { ?d a neo-schema:Department ; rdfs:label ?Department . OPTIONAL { ?d neo-prop:Headcount ?Headcount } } ORDER BY DESC(?Headcount)|linkColumns=Department}}

== Browse ==

{{#invoke:NeoWikiDemo|query|SELECT DISTINCT ?Subject ?Type WHERE { VALUES ( ?schema ?Type ) { ( neo-schema:Department "Department" ) ( neo-schema:Office "Office" ) ( neo-schema:Product "Product" ) } ?s a ?schema ; rdfs:label ?Subject } ORDER BY ?Type ?Subject|linkColumns=Subject}}

